61","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/61/labels","id":5246671,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTI0NjY3MQ==","number":61,"title":"1.3.2.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":73,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-03-28T13:51:13Z","updated_at":"2020-04-14T20:14:25Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-04-08T13:12:10Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2020-04-01T16:59:38Z","updated_at":"2020-04-07T17:01:28Z","closed_at":"2020-04-06T08:12:25Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen using SSL/TLS with property quarkus.http.insecure-requests = disabled :\r\n\r\n- onStart(@Observes StartupEvent evt) is not called\r\n- Method annotated with @Scheduled are not invoked\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Create a project\r\n```\r\nmvn io.quarkus:quarkus-maven-plugin:1.3.1.Final:create -DprojectGroupId=org.acme -DprojectArtifactId=foo-server -DclassName=\"org.acme.FooResource\" -Dpath=\"/foo\" -Dextensions=\"scheduler\"\r\n```\r\n2. In src/main/java/org/acme add FooService.java\r\n```java\r\npackage org.acme;\r\n\r\nimport io.quarkus.runtime.ShutdownEvent;\r\nimport io.quarkus.runtime.StartupEvent;\r\nimport io.quarkus.scheduler.Scheduled;\r\nimport org.jboss.logging.Logger;\r\n\r\nimport javax.enterprise.context.ApplicationScoped;\r\nimport javax.enterprise.event.Observes;\r\n\r\n@ApplicationScoped\r\npublic class FooService {\r\n\r\n    private static final Logger LOGGER = Logger.getLogger(\"FooService\");\r\n\r\n    public void onStart(@Observes StartupEvent evt) {\r\n        LOGGER.info(\"The application is starting...\");\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    public void onStop(@Observes ShutdownEvent evt) {\r\n        LOGGER.info(\"The application is stopping...\");\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @Scheduled(every = \"10s\")\r\n    public void scheduledTask() {\r\n        LOGGER.info(\"scheduledTask called\");\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n```\r\n3. In src/main/resources , Create a foo.jks file with self-signed certificate\r\n```\r\nkeytool -genkey -keyalg RSA -alias selfsigned -keystore foo.jks -storepass fooPass -validity 365 -keysize 2048\r\n```\r\n4. In src/main/resources/application.properties\r\n```properties\r\nquarkus.http.insecure-requests = disabled\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-file = foo.jks\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-file-type = JKS\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-password = fooPass\r\n```\r\n\r\n**It is working if (but http stays active)**\r\nIn src/main/resources/application.properties\r\n```properties\r\n#quarkus.http.insecure-requests = disabled\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-file = foo.jks\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-file-type = JKS\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-password = fooPass\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\n - Java versions: 11 & 14\r\n - Quarkus versions: 1.3.0.Final & 1.3.1.Final\r\n",